# Innocent Blood against a regeneration shield: regeneration replaces destruction only (CR 701.19a), and sacrifice is not
# destruction (CR 701.21a). On turn 5 Bot2 gives its only creature, Ornithopter, a shield with Yavimaya Hollow in response;
# it is sacrificed regardless and the shield is not used: Ornithopter is in the graveyard, not on the battlefield tapped as a
# regenerated creature would be. Bot1's own lone creature is not in play, so only Bot2 sacrifices.

